00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:23.149
for the first time that was at the Cannes

00:06:23.149 --> 00:06:24.250
Film Festival.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.918
And it's just really striking

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:26.819
when you meet the family

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:29.722
there's such a strong physical book

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:32.625
that was passed down.

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:35.628
Elvis to Lisa Marie Riley has it.

00:06:35.628 --> 00:06:37.463
Her brother had it as well.

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:38.731
So it's almost like,

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:38.898
you know,

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:39.732
you feel like you're

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:41.100
touching a little bit of history

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.902
when you meet the family.

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:44.303
And she describes

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:46.072
how they all watched the movie together.

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:46.773
And there was this

00:06:46.773 --> 00:06:49.442
real sense of excitement.

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:50.977
Elvis, I mean, when

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:54.180
Sharon, thank you.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.348
I want to bring in

00:06:55.348 --> 00:06:56.616
CNN contributor as well,

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:57.750
Nischelle Turner.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.086
Nischelle, we know that you are driving.

00:07:00.086 --> 00:07:00.920
Thank you for being a part

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.321
of our breaking news coverage.

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:03.322
We really want to hear from you

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:04.357
because, of course,

00:07:04.357 --> 00:07:05.491
not only you're a phenomenal

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:06.626
entertainment reporter,

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:08.227
but also you had a chance

00:07:08.227 --> 00:07:09.962
to actually speak with her

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.964
at the Golden Globes to observe her.

00:07:11.964 --> 00:07:12.565
Now, again,

00:07:12.565 --> 00:07:13.733
we have no idea

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:15.802
if there is any connection whatsoever

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.471
to either how she appeared, her behavior,

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:20.072
how she felt in any way

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:21.574
on the night of the Golden Globes.

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:23.576
But it is our last ability

00:07:23.576 --> 00:07:26.312
to see how she was in the public eye

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:28.014
this past Tuesday.

00:07:28.014 --> 00:07:28.414
Tell me,

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:30.183
what was your impression upon

00:07:30.183 --> 00:07:31.617
hearing the news today?

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:33.186
Yeah, I'm

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:34.754
glad that you make that clear

00:07:34.754 --> 00:07:37.223
because we don't know.

00:07:37.223 --> 00:07:38.758
We don't know the cause of death.

00:07:38.758 --> 00:07:41.093
We don't know any of that right now

00:07:41.093 --> 00:07:41.594
except for

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:41.994
she did

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:43.262
go to the hospital today

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.932
under possible cardiac arrest.

00:07:45.932 --> 00:07:49.068
And now we have subsequently known

00:07:49.068 --> 00:07:50.236
that she has passed away.

00:07:50.236 --> 00:07:52.738
But when we did speak with her on Sunday,

00:07:52.738 --> 00:07:55.341
my my co-host, Kevin Frazier, and I

00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:58.244
she definitely did not seem at 100%.

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:00.813
She seemed subdued.

00:08:00.813 --> 00:08:03.216
She did not seem at full strength.

00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:05.017
I had just spoken with her

00:08:05.017 --> 00:08:06.686
a couple of months earlier

00:08:06.686 --> 00:08:09.188
at a footprint ceremony in Hollywood

00:08:09.722 --> 00:08:11.123
for her father, for the movie,

00:08:11.123 --> 00:08:12.358
for Austin Butler.

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:13.226
And I can tell you,

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:15.361
it was night and day difference

00:08:15.695 --> 00:08:17.763
