00:08:17.763 --> 00:08:18.798
She was very bubbly.

00:08:18.798 --> 00:08:20.700
She was very outgoing, joking.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.502
She's funny, she's glib,

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:23.402
all of those things.

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.305
She did not seem that way on Sunday,

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:28.774
